<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on four Swiss blue chips.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on four Swiss blue chips.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank (Switzerland) said it has launched 10 million American-style call warrants on four Swiss blue chip companies.</p>
<p>There are three million warrants on Alusuisse registered shares, two million warrants on Nestle registered shares, two million warrants on UBS bearer shares and three million warrants on Winterthur Insurance registered shares.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	08.DEC.97  20 WARRANTS COVER ONE SHARE.</p>
<p>* * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT (CALLS)  STRIKE	 ISSUE	  PREMIUM</p>
<p> ALLUSUISSE	 975 CHF	4.05 CHF     11.7 PCT</p>
<p> NESTLE	     1400 CHF     5.30 CHF     8.8 PCT</p>
<p> UBS		  1200 CHF     5.30 CHF     11.6 PCT</p>
<p> WINTERTHRU	 750 CHF	4.00 CHF     10.2 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
